{"id": "EUVD-2026-82013", "enisaUuid": "87d338ec-f9b1-3585-9fa9-bcd4f9114319", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: mt76: mt7915: release hif2 reference on probe IRQ failure\n\nThe hif2 reference obtained by mt7915_pci_init_hif2() is only released on\nerror paths that key off dev->hif2, which is not assigned until after the\nIRQ setup. If pci_alloc_irq_vectors() or the primary devm_request_irq()\nfails, the reference leaks. Drop it explicitly on those paths via\nmt7915_put_hif2().", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:08:59", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:02:08", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8a2e38019846da29a112fac4dd96fe5bfa298faf", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2a434d2637b9c9be9bcc8a84dc46880cc1446643", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5c30a6350a300fbb800831f1b4373b2f59e03410", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ed5cc46a3c8f4fe7f549c661914d8d835169acc0", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fb9c7b4c238b4e5469a11a1fb8cf332f6193b995", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8370aebd26a9dfa2e0de665e3ab504c0e97ee730"], "aliases": ["GHSA-cqhq-7whc-695x", "CVE-2026-90352"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "09e7a9b8-7427-3174-b5a5-9da0af3b1d88", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "f68d67623dec9445960b52a0e9e8e60297596b4b <2a434d2637b9c9be9bcc8a84dc46880cc1446643"}, {"id": "1c87d0ec-f6f3-3e81-9f6f-f47d2aa607b9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "f68d67623dec9445960b52a0e9e8e60297596b4b <ed5cc46a3c8f4fe7f549c661914d8d835169acc0"}, {"id": "2976962a-e24e-36fa-b8da-749c1f946a31", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "f68d67623dec9445960b52a0e9e8e60297596b4b <8a2e38019846da29a112fac4dd96fe5bfa298faf"}, {"id": "426957bc-a2e6-3adf-9c93-e698ff2a9989", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "f68d67623dec944596